 ```
 
+## Configuration
+
+Automatic context-maintenance nudges are enabled by default. To disable them,
+create `<Pi agent dir>/extensions/infinite-context.json` (normally
+`~/.pi/agent/extensions/infinite-context.json`):
+
+```json
+{
+  "enableNudges": false
+}
+```
+
+The setting is global and is read when a session starts. It only disables the
+agent-facing `turn_end` nudge; folding tools, tool results/errors, and the
+human-facing auto-compaction warning are unchanged. Missing or invalid config
+uses the default (`true`).
+
 ## Prior Art
 
 - [Opencode-DCP/opencode-dynamic-context-pruning](https://github.com/Opencode-DCP/opencode-dynamic-context-pruning)
